{
  "$comment": "The event catalogue: every bus event type, whether the session timeline records it, and who may publish it (core = the depot-core sidecar, backend = Depot's Rust code, frontend = a panel, for user actions only). Read by Rust (src-tauri/src/bus.rs) and TypeScript (src/types/events.ts). Payloads are documented in docs/PLUGIN_PROTOCOL.md.",
